[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429658\">7050A87</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429656\">7050A75</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429655\">7050A74</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429651\">7050A63</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429692\">7065B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429646\">7050A50</a></p><p>1. Lower the backrest onto the cushion frame.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts on both sides of the seat.</p><p>3. Remove the backrest (1) from the seat support frame (3a).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2053036.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the frame is not\ndamaged.</p><p>Position the backrest and secure it using\nthe bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429646\">7050A50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429692\">7065B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429651\">7050A63</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429655\">7050A74</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429656\">7050A75</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429658\">7050A87</a></p>"]]